  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking): Marker interfaces renamed to the I-prefix convention (IState, IRootState, IAction, IMutation, IModule), which resolves the System.Action name collision. New reactive change notification: Store and ModuleBase expose a StateChanged event and Observe(selector, onChanged) with distinct-until-changed. New companion package StateManagementSharp.Maui provides automatic, UI-thread-marshaled binding (UseStateManagementSharp, StoreBindableObject, BindableValue). See the README migration guide.",
